+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Lolren <loren.bufanu@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH] ipa: simple: expose manual exposure and gain controls
